# The Equipment clause is conditional on "that creature is attacking": cast in the main phase on a creature that is not
# attacking, Battlefield Improvisation only gives +2/+2 and asks about no Equipment (the refusal), though Lightning Greaves
# is there to be attached. The positive control, with the creature attacking, is the scenario that attaches an Equipment.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mother of Runes
Lightning Greaves
Battlefield Improvisation
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mother of Runes.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Greaves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Battlefield Improvisation.Cast(Mother of Runes)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Choose
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Lightning Greaves.AttachedTo = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Toughness = 3
